 "chunks": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 0.12,
   "end": 2.317,
   "text": "Most footballers retire around thirty-five."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 2.567,
   "end": 5.17,
   "text": "Players his age are on TV, talking about football."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 5.42,
   "end": 9.367,
   "text": "Cristiano Ronaldo is forty-one. And he's still chasing one thousand goals."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 9.617,
   "end": 10.897,
   "text": "How? Let's follow his day."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 11.397,
   "end": 14.191,
   "text": "Morning. He wakes up rested, because he treats sleep like training."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 14.441,
   "end": 16.98,
   "text": "Reportedly, that even includes short naps through the day."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 17.23,
   "end": 19.577,
   "text": "Breakfast? Lots of protein. Very little sugar."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 19.827,
   "end": 23.005,
   "text": "He once moved two soda bottles off a press table and held up water."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 23.255,
   "end": 25.197,
   "text": "And alcohol? He's said he doesn't drink."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 25.697,
   "end": 28.875,
   "text": "Then training. Sprints. Weights. Extra shooting after everyone leaves."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 29.125,
   "end": 31.429,
   "text": "Teammates often say: first in, last out."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 31.679,
   "end": 33.898,
   "text": "That's how a forty-one year old still jumps like this."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 34.148,
   "end": 36.943,
   "text": "One header was measured at over two and a half meters high."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 37.193,
   "end": 39.155,
   "text": "He later takes an ice cold shower."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 39.405,
   "end": 41.603,
   "text": "Then rest. Then repeat. Every single day."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 42.103,
   "end": 44.279,
   "text": "The result? Over nine hundred and seventy goals."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 44.529,
   "end": 45.723,
   "text": "The GOAT of football."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 45.973,
   "end": 48.235,
   "text": "Six World Cups. A league title at forty-one."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 48.485,
   "end": 50.767,
   "text": "Talent got him started. Habits kept him going."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 51.017,
   "end": 54.196,
   "text": "So next time you skip a workout, remember who's still training at forty-one."
  }
 ]
}